----------------------------------------------------------------------
Scored core
----------------------------------------------------------------------
The scored benchmark (the generated "flow:*" prefetch workloads and the
"recall:*" workloads, together with their generators, oracle/ceiling, and
metrics) is original work and contains no third-party data. It is fully
synthetic and reproducible from seeds.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
Optional third-party data (NOT redistributed, NOT part of the scored core)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
The optional real-world cross-check workload "alfworld:action" (and the
"alfworld:verb" extra) reads the ALFWorld SFT trajectories from:

    agent-eto/eto-sft-trajectory  (ETO / ALFWorld), licensed MIT.

No ALFWorld data is included in this distribution. It is fetched on demand
by `python -m janus.datasets --download alfworld` directly from the source
above, and is used only to show that the generated-data findings replicate
on a real agent dataset. Users who download it are bound by that dataset's
own license.
